CM ============================================================
CM TRAPPED DIPOLE: 80M / 40M / 20M / 15M / 10M (5-BAND)
CM Parallel resonant coaxial traps, horizontal, 15m AGL
CM NEC-2 / EZNEC compatible
CM
CM Architecture (one side from feed outward):
CM   Feed
CM   -> [10M trap at 2.64m]
CM   -> [15M trap at 3.54m]
CM   -> [20M trap at 5.26m]
CM   -> [40M trap at 10.05m]
CM   -> tip at 20.1m
CM
CM Note: 15M uses loading effect of traps, not isolated element.
CM Standard W3DZZ / commercial multiband trap dipole topology.
CM
CM Trap parameters (all RG-213):
CM   10M trap: f0=28.5  MHz, L=0.50uH, C=63pF,  Q=55, Rp=4863  ohm
CM   15M trap: f0=21.225MHz, L=0.74uH, C=75pF,  Q=63, Rp=6246  ohm
CM   20M trap: f0=14.175MHz, L=1.23uH, C=103pF, Q=77, Rp=8452  ohm
CM   40M trap: f0=7.150 MHz, L=2.87uH, C=173pF, Q=109,Rp=14024 ohm
CM
CM Wire layout (half dipole, feed at center, wires go in -X direction):
CM   W1:  0.00 to -2.64m  (inner, 10M element)
CM   W2: -2.64 to -3.54m  (10M to 15M trap)
CM   W3: -3.54 to -5.26m  (15M to 20M trap)
CM   W4: -5.26 to -10.05m (20M to 40M trap)
CM   W5:-10.05 to -20.10m (40M to tip)
CM Mirror for +X side: W6-W10
